## KHỐI HỌC · 13:30–16:00

### Mock set A (45 phút)

1. Tell me about yourself (fullstack + AI application angle)
2. Walk a request finger → DB → back
3. Why Fastify over Express in production?
4. How do you add LLM features without putting keys on the phone? (+ RAG boundary)
5. Why leaving / why this company (behavioral ngắn)

**Rubric** (mỗi câu 1–5 × 5 trục như coding-context): Decision · Example · Honesty · Time · Follow-up. Tổng <15 drill lại.

